Data notice: Survey responses processed by this application are collected
anonymously. No names, contact details, or other directly identifying
information are requested or stored. Standard technical metadata that is
automatically transmitted by any web browser (such as device type, operating
system, browser type, and IP address) may be collected and used for basic
analytics (e.g. breakdown of responses by device or browser) and duplicate-
response prevention. This metadata is not linked to any respondent's
identity. Aggregated data is used exclusively for academic research purposes
and is not shared with third parties or used for any commercial purpose.

